      "en": "• Contains a large number of marks that can be attached to the plastic model of \"Mobile Suit Gundam GQuuuuuuX\" to enhance the details of the aircraft!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「GQuuuuuuX（ジークアクス）」等に対応したデカールも付属。",
      "en": "• Decals compatible with \"GQuuuuuuX\" etc. are also included."
    }
